
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Cricket Score Updates</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #061525;
      color: white;
    }
    header {
      background: #0b2638;
      padding: 22px 14px;
      text-align: center;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #20e66b;
    }
    h1 { color: #20e66b; font-size: 25px; }
    nav {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-around;
      padding: 15px 4px;
      background: #10283b;
    }
    nav a { color: white; text-decoration: none; }
    main { padding: 15px; }
    .match {
      background: #10283b;
      border: 1px solid #24506a;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 16px;
      margin: 12px 0;
    }
    .live { color: #20e66b; font-weight: bold; }
    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
      color: #b7c7d4;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>🏏 Cricket Score Updates</h1>
    <p>All Matches • Live Scores • Match Results</p>
  </header>
  <nav>
    <a href="#live">Live</a>
    <a href="#upcoming">Upcoming</a>
    <a href="#results">Results</a>
  </nav>
  <main>
    <h2 id="live">🔴 Live Matches</h2>
    <div class="match">
      <span class="live">● LIVE DEMO</span>
      <h3>India vs Australia</h3>
      <p>Score will appear here when live data is connected.</p>
    </div>
    <h2 id="upcoming">📅 Upcoming Matches</h2>
    <div class="match">
      Match schedules will appear here.
    </div>
    <h2 id="results">🏆 Match Results</h2>
    <div class="match">
      Match results will appear here.
    </div>
  </main>
  <footer>
    Cricket Score Updates © 2026
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
